<title>INDIA: India's RBI gives repo auctions calendar for July.</title>
<headline>India's RBI gives repo auctions calendar for July.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Thursday announced the schedule for securities repurchase auctions in July.</p>
<p>The repo auctions will be open to parties holding SGL account and current account with the RBI.</p>
<p>The following are the details of the auction</p>
<p>Date of auction  Date of payment   Period  Repurchase date</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>June 27, 1997     June 28, 1997	4 days    June  2, 1997</p>
<p>July 1		July 2		 3 days    July  5</p>
<p>July 4		July 5		 3 days    July  8</p>
<p>July 7		July 8		 3 days    July  11</p>
<p>July 10	     July 11		4 days    July  15</p>
<p>July 14	     July 15		4 days    July  19</p>
<p>July 17	     July 19		3 days    July  22</p>
<p>July 21	     July 22		3 days    July  25</p>
<p>July 24	     July 25		4 days    July  29</p>
<p>July 28	     July 29		3 days    Aug   1</p>
<p>July 31	     Aug  1		 4 days    Aug   5</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
